[1] Store FAQ (Batteries and power). Do automatic watches need a battery? No. They are powered by the movement of your wrist.

[2] Store FAQ (General). Do you buy or exchange old watches? Through the old-watch exchange offer on Veyra Atelier only.

[3] Store FAQ (Store visit). Can I use the kiosk to find a watch and then see it? Yes. The kiosk can search the catalogue, check stock and call a staff member to bring the watch to you.

